            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Embroider the nose in cream with a small oval. Add tiny cream ear patches using satin stitch. Weave in all ends. Brush the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "amigurumi-decrease"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "fluffy tail"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " lightly with a soft-bristle brush to lift the fibres."
          }
